<title>USA: Angola seeks 17,850 T U.S. HRW wheat - agent.</title>
<headline>Angola seeks 17,850 T U.S. HRW wheat - agent.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Angola is seeking a maximum of 17,850 tonnes of U.S. No.2 or better hard red winter wheat in bulk under the PL 480, Title I, export donation program, its U.S. export agent said.</p>
<p>The delivery period is set for October 10-25.</p>
<p>Bids must be received by September 24 and remain valid until September 25.</p>
<p>The wheat must originate in areas of the United States where Karnal Bunt is not known to exist.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
